<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Autoways suspension extend.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Autoways suspension extend.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The suspension of trading in shares of Malaysia's Autoways Holdings Bhd has been extended by three market days to January 13, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>KLSE said the extension, given at the company's request, was to help Autoways complete a &quot;material transaction involving the company&quot;.</p>
<p>Trading in Autoways shares have been suspended since December 24.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
